# An agent given its own worktree checks the repository out under here. The hooks and the
# settings beside it are the project's and are tracked; a working copy of the project inside
# the project is not.
.claude/worktrees/

# The projects root when BENCH_PROJECTS is unset (tools/projects.py, web/server/projects.ts):
# the maker's own work, not the repository's.
/projects/
